{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260224004212be6542ff07124f9e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The `trinity-nexus/lang/src/` contains only compiler-related files (the VIBEE compiler itself). The additional files in `src/vibeec/` like agent files, bitnet files, etc., are not part of the compiler - they're CLI tools and utilities that use the compiler.\n\nThis is an important distinction. The `trinity-nexus/lang` module is specifically for the VIBEE compiler, while `src/vibeec/` contains additional tools that use the compiler.\n\nLet me check the symb module comparison:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"981639af-0629-4dff-be1c-24fc61edb06a","uuid":"60d4a645-f8e5-42c1-a546-fab9dd4ee73b"}
